      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "つねに死臭を漂わせるくらいじゃなきゃ\nボクの仲間には相応しくないよ。\n“屍獄のデュナンゾ”と、一戦交えてみなよ！\n仲間になるって話はその後考えるからさ。",
        "official_en": "You want me around, you've got to have the stench\nof death on you. Go fight Corpse-Gaol Dunanzo and\nmaybe I'll join your little crew.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
